SUMMARY:International Day of Persons with Disabilities
DESCRIPTION:This international observance promotes the rights\, inclusion\, and well-being of people with disabilities. It reminds us to identify and remove barriers\, improve accessibility\, and recognize the leadership\, experiences\, and contributions of disabled people in building more equitable communities. \nLearn more at the United Nations.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/international-day-of-persons-with-disabilities/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/en-logo2019-day-of-persons-with-disabilities.jpg
